ons, which are closely monitored to ensure ideal growth. <\/p><p>We have developed an innovative advanced energy efficient hydrodynamic growth system that replicates a natural river flow.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_new_window":false,"show_button_style":"primary"}},"template--21744477274413__0aa66ebd-7b73-48de-9bbb-102c31b3bd77-column-3":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BioG_Process_image_3.jpg","image_link":"","open_new_window_image":false,"sub_title":"","title":"Harvesting","highlight_type":"underline","heading_size":120,"text":"<p>Once mature, the Chlorella is carefully harvested to preserve its nutritional integrity. Our cultivation process ensures that we consistently produce a high-quality product. When harvested we apply an advanced biodynamic technology to gently crack the hard outer cell wall making the nutrients fully available.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_new_window":false,"show_button_style":"primary"}},"template--21744477274413__0aa66ebd-7b73-48de-9bbb-102c31b3bd77-column-4":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/rhys-moult-7eaFIKeo1MQ-unsplash.jpg","image_link":"","open_new_window_image":false,"sub_title":"","title":"Distribution","highlight_type":"underline","heading_size":120,"text":"<p>After harvesting, the Chlorella is processed, dried, and packaged with minimal processing to maintain its nutritional benefits. It is then distributed directly to consumers and businesses, ensuring freshness and quality.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","open_new_window":false,"show_button_style":"primary"}}},"block_order":["template--21744477274413__0aa66ebd-7b73-48de-9bbb-102c31b3bd77-column-1","template--21744477274413__0aa66ebd-7b73-48de-9bbb-102c31b3bd77-column-2","template--21744477274413__0aa66ebd-7b73-48de-9bbb-102c31b3bd77-column-3","template--21744477274413__0aa66ebd-7b73-48de-9bbb-102c31b3bd77-column-4"],"settings":{"title":"","highlight_type":"underline","he